    "detection_keywords": "(?i)(\\bai[- ]?(text |content |writing )?detect\\w*|\\bdetectors?\\b|watermark\\w*|provenance|pangram|gptzero|turnitin|copyleaks|originality\\.ai|academic (integrity|misconduct)|plagiari\\w+|ai[- ]generated (text|writing|essays?|papers?|content|books?|articles?)|written (with|by) (ai|chatgpt|claude)|ai[- ]written|synthid|c2pa|content credentials|authorship|deepfake detect\\w*|false positives?|ai allegations?|accused of (using )?ai|human[- ]written)",
